-  `m_repoActionsTab` in the build loop (like `m_repoIssuesTab` at i==2,
-  `m_repoPullsTab` at i==4) and update them when the repo opens / data reloads
-  (`openRepoDetail`, `loadCommits`, `reloadAgents`, `refreshRepoActions`).
